%S A399710 1,1,7,144,10631,2815773,2673772560,9072810111085,109692502957592388,
%T A399710 4714391150045007156449,718998051450099779771721784
%N A399710 Number of maximal antichains in C_n^3.
%C A399710 Here C_n is the chain 0 < 1 < ... < n-1, and C_n^3 consists of all triples (i,j,k), ordered coordinatewise.
%C A399710 In the notation of Bouyssou, Marchant and Pirlot, a(n) = D_F(n,3).
%H A399710 Dennis Bouyssou, Thierry Marchant and Marc Pirlot, <a href="https://www.lamsade.dauphine.fr/~bouyssou/BouyssouMarchantPirlot2025.pdf">ELECTRE TRI-nB, pseudo-disjunctive: axiomatic and combinatorial results</a>, 2025.
%e A399710 For n=2, C_2^3 is the Boolean lattice B_3 and has 7 maximal antichains.
%Y A399710 Cf. A008793 (all antichains in C_n^3), A326358 (maximal antichains in the Boolean lattice).
%K A399710 nonn,hard,more,new
%O A399710 0,3
